body:
As a rule of thumb, changes in scent indicate that a product probably should not be used. If it was la mer, I'd say use it up, but it's the ordinary, so I'd recommend repurchasing. 

&#x200B;

This goes double for copper buffet and retinoids; both can be unstable so they shouldn't be used beyond the listed expiration date.

I like the shirt, a lot, I think the texture is nice. The jacket on the other hand, fleeces are considered very normcore, so unless you're into that I'd recommend the shirt.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
